        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>24 Inch Lockable Entry Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLooking for a front door replacement pull but don't know where to start? The Stainless Steel Exterior Door Pull Handles with Deadbolt has everything you'll need to add a 24 Inch Lockable Entry Handle to your home. It comes packaged as a set that includes a pair of back-to-back mounted pulls and a single cylinder deadbolt. This Contemporary Stainless Steel Front Door Set combines a sleek look with heavy duty security; and since it is made out of stainless steel with a brushed stainless steel finish, it is durable enough for commercial applications but looks stylish enough for your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-STR06024A2-specifications.gif?v=1704442283\" width=\"580\" height=\"159\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-STR06024S7 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>About the Function:</b> The Single Cylinder Deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior. The Back to Back Mounted Pull attach to one another through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Stainless Steel Front Door Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Entry Door Pull with Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1.88\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness 1-3/8\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 (two) pulls and a single cylinder deadbolt.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Exterior Door Pull Handles with Deadbolt",
